    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n1. Create a \"WhatsApp Business Cloud\" credential (Access Token + Business Account ID from Meta > WhatsApp > API Setup) and select it in Send WhatsApp Reply.\n2. WhatsApp Trigger uses the Meta Client ID/Secret OAuth credential. Publish, then subscribe the callback URL to \"messages\" in the Meta dashboard.\n3. Set the support team email in Notify Support Team.\n4. Edit company_info in Extract Message Fields with your real FAQ content.\n5. Logs go to the \"AI Customer Support Logs\" sheet.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
