    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Logic\nKeywords route each message: human/agent/urgent, refund/billing, complaint/problem, hours, order/delivery. Anything else goes to Gemini, which may answer ONLY from company_info; if it has no reliable answer a ticket row is logged and a holding reply is sent. HIGH priority cases email a human. Meta status receipts (no message) are ignored.",
